# news title
#. news title
msgctxt "20260311.html"
msgid "Release GCompris 26.1"
msgstr "Выпуск GCompris 26.1"

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20260311.html"
msgid "Today we are releasing GCompris version 26.1."
msgstr "Сегодня мы выпускаем GCompris версии 26.1."

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20260311.html"
msgid "It contains bug fixes and improvements on many activities."
msgstr "Он содержит исправления ошибок и улучшения во многих заданиях."

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20260311.html"
msgid "It is fully translated in the following languages:"
msgstr "Он полностью переведён на следующие языки:"

#. list item
msgctxt "20260311.html"
msgid "{{ oneLocale }}"
msgstr "{{ oneLocale }}"

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20260311.html"
msgid "It is also partially translated in the following languages:"
msgstr "Также он частично переведён на следующие языки:"

#. The arguments are the language name and its percentage of completion. Keep
#. the entries {{ oneLocale }} and {{ oneStatus }} as this, only move the %
#. and/or reverse the order if needed for your locale.
msgctxt "20260311.html"
msgid "{{ oneLocale }} ({{ oneStatus }}%)"
msgstr "{{ oneLocale }} ({{ oneStatus }}%)"

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20260311.html"
msgid ""
"You can find packages of this new version for GNU/Linux, Windows, Android, "
"and Raspberry Pi on the <a href=\\\"https://gcompris.net/"
"downloads{{ suffix }}.html\\\">download page</a>. Also this update will soon "
"be available in the Android Play store, the F-Droid repository and the "
"Windows store."
msgstr ""
"Пакеты этой новой версии для GNU/Linux, Windows, Android и Raspberry Pi "
"доступны на <a href=\\\"https://gcompris.net/downloads{{ suffix }}.html\\"
"\">странице загрузки</a>. Кроме того, это обновление скоро появится в "
"Android Play Store, репозитории F-Droid и Windows Store."

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20260311.html"
msgid "Thank you all, <br/>Timothée & Johnny"
msgstr "Спасибо всем, <br/>Timothée и Johnny"

