msgid ""
"It is both. From the beginning, GCompris has always been and still is a GNU "
"package. Since 2014 it is maintained by the KDE community."
msgstr ""
"И то, и другое. С самого начала GCompris была и остаётся пакетом GNU. С 2014 "
