"приложение."

#: template/faq.html:73
msgid "Why is it not available on the amazon store?"
msgstr "Почему приложения нет в магазине Amazon?"

#: template/faq.html:74
msgid ""
"For android we already publish on the Play store and F-Droid, publishing on "
"all the stores would require too much work. If you are using a Fire tablet, "
"you can directly install the latest apk from our website, and use a third "
